ac048c3c8b9c62e5f46e5.mp4?t=1767721461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain a <strong>bike mount</strong> to get around the world quickly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain a <strong>pet</strong> that fights alongside you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character</strong> with different hair and face styles! Collect random cosmetic equipment from the gacha machine!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy a home</strong> that helps you fast-travel around the open world!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Piokou"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900870/00442262f446ba45f4087773907fcbf1dd425559/header.jpg?t=1767721461","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.11+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB Cideo Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2900870/1361770234/6c3485a6d19b5c6583ea12ed2b0f24b6386568f1/1767633476/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767634905","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2900870/1361770234/6c3485a6d19b5c6583ea12ed2b0f24b6386568f1/1767633476/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767634905","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2900870/1361770234/6c3485a6d19b5c6583ea12ed2b0f24b6386568f1/1767633476/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767634905","id":257259984,"name":"Yuma Nest - Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257259984/e017fe94aaab90b7cb2